### =====================================================
### Update Users Status (batch) - Test Cases (WD-1433)
### =====================================================

### Test 1: Suspend several users
POST {{baseUrl}}/user/updateUsersStatus
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userIds": [
    2687,
    2649
  ],
  "newStatus": 2
}

### Test 2: Reactivate users
POST {{baseUrl}}/user/updateUsersStatus
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userIds": [
    2687,
    2649
  ],
  "newStatus": 1
}

### Test 3: Sin token de autorización → 401
POST {{baseUrl}}/user/updateUsersStatus
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userIds": [
    2687
  ],
  "newStatus": 2
}

### Test 4: Error - newStatus inválido (permitidos: 0, 1, 2) → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/user/updateUsersStatus
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userIds": [
    2687
  ],
  "newStatus": 5
}

### Test 5: Error - lista de userIds vacía → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/user/updateUsersStatus
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userIds": [],
  "newStatus": 2
}
